  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging Innovation and Learning in TVET (BILT) project Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BILT 3 project supports Member States in Europe, Africa and Asia-Pacific regions in making progress in integrating new qualifications and competencies in their TVET systems and institutional practices. At its third phase of implementation, BILT 3 will focus on adjusting skills/competence definitions; standards; curricula; teaching; qualifications and learning delivery and processes. 
For the duration of the project, the focus will be on &apos;Digitalization and NQC&apos; and on &apos;Greening and NQC&apos; and their convergence, which will facilitate an understanding of the state-of-play, generate new knowledge and share information on national TVET practices.</narrative>
  </description>
